# 🧠 六、Runtime Layer（执行层）

---

## 🧠 每个 Skill → runtime

| Skill               | Runtime           |
| ------------------- | ----------------- |
| semantic similarity | embedding + FAISS |
| image detection     | CV model / pHash  |
| stats analysis      | Python (scipy)    |
| reasoning           | GPT-5.5           |
| graph analysis      | NetworkX          |

---

## 🧠 示例：

```text
Text Analysis → embedding + vector DB
Image Analysis → CV pipeline
Data Analysis → statistical engine
Synthesis → LLM reasoning
```

---

👉 本质：

> ❗RAMS = **多计算系统编排器**

---

# 🧠 七、Execution（并行调查🔥）

---

```text
TEAM executes:

Plagiarism Analyst → finds similar text
Image Expert → finds duplicated figures
Data Auditor → flags statistical anomalies
Citation Analyst → detects citation patterns
```

---

然后：

```text
Chief Reviewer → aggregates evidence
```

---

👉 本质：

> ❗不是生成答案，而是“并行取证 + 汇总”

