# 🧠 八、输出（关键差异点）

---

## ❌ 传统工具输出：

* “相似度 23%”

---

## ✅ RAMS输出：

```text
Academic Investigation Report

Risk Score: 78/100 ⚠️

Findings:

1. Text:
- Section 2.3 similar to Paper X (0.89)

2. Image:
- Figure 4 duplicated from Figure 2 (rotated)

3. Data:
- Distribution too uniform (p < 0.01 anomaly)

4. Citation:
- 65% references from same cluster

Conclusion:
High likelihood of manipulation
```

---

👉 核心：

> ❗**证据链（Evidence Chain）**

